Spec: Public Windows connection IPC boundary verification

Purpose:
  Verify negotiation, original-byte validation, typed correlation and unknown mutation outcomes independently of transport fixtures.

Owns:
  ./FormalApiTests.cs

Must:
  Use owned local pipes and an explicitly synthetic provider; never present this boundary test as actual remote authorization or business transfer.
  Cover experimental opt-in, original nested policy limits before provider invocation, required mutation IDs and malformed reply outcome preservation.
